    RefIds:
    - rid: 3401386992335323136
      type: {class: DialogueText, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        Text: Oh, are you a traveler?
    - rid: 3401386992335323137
      type: {class: DialogueText, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        Text: Our village has been having trouble getting supplies lately.
    - rid: 3401386992335323138
      type: {class: DialogueText, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        Text: Our scouts have spotted a large Desert Golem that they believe is trapping
          supply crates.
    - rid: 3401386992335323139
      type: {class: DialogueText, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        Text: I hate to ask this of an outsider, but would you be willing to try
          to take down this foe?
    - rid: 3401386992335323143
      type: {class: DialogueText, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        Text: Oh thank you traveler! Perhaps your arrival was a boon sent to us by
          the Gods.
    - rid: 3401386992335323144
      type: {class: DialogueText, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        Text: I understand. It may be best to not involve an outsider in our affairs...
    - rid: 3401386992813211715
      type: {class: DialogueEnd, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data: 
